ortfin Mako Sharks and Tiger Sharks, when provoked will hunt you down and become your worst nightmare. </li></ul><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/330580/extras/a682edf66b3c360843cdb374d0b57b6d.avif?t=1675792361\" /></div>",
